{"sections":[{"slug":"A-hat类","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"A-hat类"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“A-hat <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“A-hat 类”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>A-hat <span lang=\"zh\">类是如下</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Dirac算子","text":"Dirac <span lang=\"zh\">算子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的指标</span>:\n$$\r\nc\\circ\\nabla\\colon\\Gamma(S^+)\\to \\Gamma(S^-),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $S=S^+\\oplus S^-$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自旋流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自旋流形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/旋量丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">旋量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", $c$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Clifford代数","text":"Clifford <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">到外代数的象征映射</span>, $\\nabla$ <span lang=\"zh\">为旋量丛上的协变导数</span>.</p>\n<p>A-hat <span lang=\"zh\">类自然地在</span> $SO_n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/指数映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">指数映射</span> (Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>)"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Jacobi <span lang=\"zh\">行列式中出现</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个</span> Jacobi <span lang=\"zh\">行列式依赖于底流形的曲率</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可逐纤维地计算</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">这里会出现</span> $j$-<span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>\n$$\r\nj(X)=\\frac{\\sinh (X/2)}{X/2}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在近复流形上</span>, A-hat <span lang=\"zh\">类与</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Todd类","text":"Todd <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">只相差</span> $e^{c_1/2}$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">与曲率的关系</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $2n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维紧可定向</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>, $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲率形式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲率形式</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>\n$$\r\n\\widehat{A}(M)=\\det \\left(\\frac{R/2}{\\sinh R/2}\\right)^{1/2}.\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">有的定义将这里的</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">替换为</span> $R/(2\\pi i)$.) <span lang=\"zh\">它是一个闭形式</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且不依赖于</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量的选取</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">乘性序列</span></h2>\n<p>A-hat <span lang=\"zh\">类来自以</span> $\\displaystyle \\frac{\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{z}}{\\operatorname{sinh}(\\frac{1}{2}z)}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为特征幂级数的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/乘性序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">乘性序列</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}